WEBVTT

00:26.600 --> 00:27.160
Master.

00:27.640 --> 00:28.770
You wanted to see me?

00:32.240 --> 00:34.240
You used human lives to set the trap.

00:34.880 --> 00:36.520
You're a fast learner.

00:36.920 --> 00:38.240
Thanks to you,

00:39.030 --> 00:40.520
Zhang Yinhua, every three to five years,

00:40.520 --> 00:41.980
comes to perform a ritual.

00:42.150 --> 00:43.880
It can bring a lot of gold to the sect.

00:43.880 --> 00:46.790
I taught you to hunt wild Paozi,

00:47.320 --> 00:49.200
not the souls of young ladies.

00:49.350 --> 00:51.480
Is the killing really that important?

00:51.640 --> 00:52.750
Didn't you ask me

00:52.750 --> 00:53.920
to kill Li Yingjuan?

00:53.920 --> 00:57.560
I killed her to save thousands of lives
in the sect.

00:57.810 --> 00:59.170
Now you kill people

00:59.280 --> 01:02.480
to feed your greed.

01:04.150 --> 01:05.480
You're exaggerating.

01:05.920 --> 01:07.920
I'm just following your teachings.

01:08.070 --> 01:10.800
After all, I'm not the only one
who needs to be fed.

01:11.000 --> 01:12.400
Didn't you teach me this?

01:12.640 --> 01:15.120
Sometimes dead people are more useful
than the living.

01:15.120 --> 01:17.920
The century-old foundation
of Tianxiang Sect

01:19.430 --> 01:21.680
isn't built on killing,

01:21.840 --> 01:23.870
but on rules that terrify the wicked

01:24.310 --> 01:26.789
and are respected by the good.

01:26.789 --> 01:28.120
Rules?

01:30.289 --> 01:32.740
Ask the brothers out there
who have taken a bullet.

01:32.740 --> 01:35.380
Do they like the loyalty
Second Master speak of

01:35.890 --> 01:38.090
or the clinking of silver dollars?

01:38.479 --> 01:40.990
The brothers in the sect are wild horses.

01:41.680 --> 01:43.789
You're the one holding the reins!

01:44.000 --> 01:46.840
You have to teach them
benevolence, righteousness, and ethics.

01:46.840 --> 01:49.560
You can't let them tread further into danger.

01:49.560 --> 01:51.680
That's what you should do!

01:51.870 --> 01:53.350
In times of peace,

01:53.430 --> 01:55.100
we might not need to kill.

01:55.590 --> 01:57.950
But look at the world out there now.

01:58.280 --> 02:00.280
We can't fool those in high power.

02:00.440 --> 02:01.200
Those with guns

02:01.200 --> 02:02.870
can take our lives at any time.

02:03.070 --> 02:05.120
What do you expect us to live on?

02:05.640 --> 02:09.080
We can only rely on people
like Zhang Yinhua.

02:13.080 --> 02:14.310
Do you know

02:15.240 --> 02:17.870
why Tianxiang Sect exists?

02:22.079 --> 02:23.280
To uphold justice?

02:23.380 --> 02:26.110
It was to overthrow the Qing and restore the Ming.

02:27.079 --> 02:27.760
But

02:27.920 --> 02:30.350
the Qing Dynasty has fallen.

02:35.070 --> 02:36.600
The Tianxiang Sect

02:39.829 --> 02:42.040
should no longer exist either.

02:45.110 --> 02:47.040
We should have disbanded long ago.

02:47.210 --> 02:48.980
We've been with you for so long

02:49.079 --> 02:50.910
and done so much for you.

02:51.370 --> 02:53.530
And you're just going to disband us
just like that?

02:53.530 --> 02:55.770
What do you want to do, then?

02:56.180 --> 02:58.980
That'll depend on whether the brothers accept it.

03:42.350 --> 03:43.390
Master.

03:46.079 --> 03:48.470
It's time to make room
for the new world.

03:51.000 --> 03:52.400
All right.

03:53.000 --> 03:53.960
I'll

03:54.360 --> 03:55.680
do a final reading

03:56.120 --> 03:58.000
for you today.

04:00.990 --> 04:02.820
Kan and Li are in opposition,

04:03.550 --> 04:05.550
an ominous star offends the Dipper.

04:06.400 --> 04:07.150
Today,

04:07.550 --> 04:10.200
the brothers who risk their lives for you

04:10.710 --> 04:11.520
will one day be

04:11.940 --> 04:14.430
the evil spirits that take your life.

04:15.030 --> 04:15.840
Second,

04:16.310 --> 04:17.829
in your life,

04:18.120 --> 04:19.970
the Solitary Phoenix star stirs.

04:19.970 --> 04:21.000
Your lover

04:21.339 --> 04:24.600
will eventually become
the arrow that pierces your heart.

04:24.600 --> 04:26.860
You will never enjoy the bliss of family.

04:27.040 --> 04:27.920
Third,

04:28.440 --> 04:31.200
you can't hide your thoughts.

04:33.470 --> 04:34.190
It's time to go.

04:34.190 --> 04:35.510
You never know

04:36.190 --> 04:38.120
when to pull in the net.

04:57.460 --> 05:00.120
-Welcome, Sect Master!
-Welcome, Sect Master!

06:44.470 --> 06:48.480
[A Prophet]

06:49.140 --> 06:51.380
[Episode 24]

06:52.630 --> 06:53.600
It's time.

06:54.750 --> 06:55.390
Execute!

07:21.190 --> 07:31.480
-Kill!
-Kill!

07:49.190 --> 07:50.120
Fourth Brother,

07:50.440 --> 07:52.270
please do me one last favor.

07:54.159 --> 07:55.159
Find Silly Liang.

07:55.390 --> 07:57.070
He'll take you to Jialing Hotel.

07:57.070 --> 07:57.560
Director Feng!

07:57.560 --> 07:58.680
Go find Feng Siyuan.

07:58.680 --> 07:59.600
Stop making a scene.

07:59.600 --> 08:00.160
Director Feng!

08:00.160 --> 08:00.800
Tell him

08:01.480 --> 08:02.950
the strong wind is about to rise.

08:02.950 --> 08:03.800
Director Feng!

08:03.800 --> 08:05.600
The strong wind is about to rise.

08:14.970 --> 08:17.770
I didn't expect you to grace us with your presence.

08:21.600 --> 08:22.860
Are you Director Wang?

08:25.390 --> 08:26.520
Who the hell are you?

08:29.160 --> 08:29.750
Take him down.

08:29.750 --> 08:30.430
Wait.

08:32.789 --> 08:35.049
Is there some kind of misunderstanding?

08:36.549 --> 08:39.200
This is why I say Sect Master is my lucky star.

08:40.030 --> 08:41.100
You asked me to go east,

08:41.100 --> 08:42.230
but I went west.

08:43.120 --> 08:45.730
I just took the seat as Deputy Director
of the Field Headquarters.

08:45.730 --> 08:47.230
Then I must congratulate you.

08:47.230 --> 08:48.900
Right in your territory,

08:50.740 --> 08:52.340
we caught a wanted criminal.

08:53.630 --> 08:54.630
Director Feng,

08:55.150 --> 08:56.480
welcome.

08:56.670 --> 08:59.130
Forgive me for not coming out to welcome you.

09:01.240 --> 09:02.440
It's confirmed that

09:02.470 --> 09:04.480
Wang Zhicheng,
Chief of Yucheng Police Station,

09:04.480 --> 09:05.910
has committed 3 felonies.

09:05.910 --> 09:06.720
The evidence is conclusive.

09:06.720 --> 09:07.600
He is to be lawfully arrested,

09:07.600 --> 09:08.670
by the Yucheng Field Headquarters.

09:08.670 --> 09:09.960
Approved by Director Feng.

09:09.960 --> 09:10.820
Director Feng.

09:10.830 --> 09:12.790
We both serve the Party and the State.

09:12.790 --> 09:14.200
You can't just listen to others' instigations!

09:14.200 --> 09:15.000
Take him away!

09:16.360 --> 09:17.220
Director Feng.

09:17.790 --> 09:18.390
Director Feng!

09:18.390 --> 09:20.030
Please let me explain, Director Feng.

09:20.030 --> 09:20.760
Sect Master!

09:21.290 --> 09:23.220
Sect Master, save me! Sect Master!

09:23.510 --> 09:24.270
Sect Master!

09:25.790 --> 09:27.320
The third wife of Wang Zhicheng

09:27.320 --> 09:28.480
is my man.

09:28.910 --> 09:30.110
She has already

09:30.600 --> 09:32.200
recorded down everything

09:32.510 --> 09:34.080
about Wang Zhicheng bribery.

09:34.080 --> 09:36.840
These are the details
and photos of his bribery.

09:37.080 --> 09:39.840
Giving Wang Zhicheng's
political achievements to Feng Siyuan

09:39.840 --> 09:41.170
is just our first move.

09:41.790 --> 09:43.200
He just arrived in Yucheng

09:43.200 --> 09:45.030
and is anxious to gain a foothold.

09:45.030 --> 09:46.790
The one he wants
to curry favor with the most right now

09:46.790 --> 09:48.030
must be Chairman Liu.

09:49.000 --> 09:51.470
Chairman Liu was a military man
in his early years.

09:51.470 --> 09:53.150
He pacified the various warlords.

09:53.150 --> 09:55.270
Once the territory he conquered was stable,

09:55.270 --> 09:57.330
he changed into the chairman's gown.

09:57.550 --> 09:58.200
Rice wine,

09:58.390 --> 09:59.030
well salt,

09:59.240 --> 09:59.960
and opium—

10:00.150 --> 10:02.320
all these lucrative trades
must go through the chairman's hands.

10:02.320 --> 10:04.000
Even if God wants to rain,

10:04.040 --> 10:05.550
he'd have to wire the provincial office

10:05.550 --> 10:07.010
to ask for his permission.

10:07.700 --> 10:09.500
Chairman Liu is high and mighty.

10:09.510 --> 10:10.840
but only Sect Master...

10:13.440 --> 10:15.240
knows what he's truly thinking.

10:15.750 --> 10:16.510
Next,

10:16.530 --> 10:18.960
we're going to feed this ambitious Feng Siyuan

10:18.960 --> 10:20.760
a completely fabricated story.

10:21.150 --> 10:22.080
From now on,

10:22.550 --> 10:24.360
this book will be called the Yin Book.

10:24.360 --> 10:25.960
We need to make Feng Siyuan believe

10:25.960 --> 10:27.440
that this is Sect Master's secret weapon.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.960
As long as he possesses the Yin Book,

10:28.960 --> 10:30.200
Feng Siyuan will have

10:30.750 --> 10:32.630
glory and wealth in Yucheng.

10:32.790 --> 10:35.190
So now we need to lead Feng Siyuan by the nose

10:35.600 --> 10:37.960
and make him seek out Sect Master on his own.

10:37.960 --> 10:39.870
The calligraphy you and your mentor

10:39.870 --> 10:41.530
got your hands on a few days ago

10:41.720 --> 10:43.250
is the best stepping stone.

10:43.480 --> 10:44.360
Director Feng.

10:44.480 --> 10:45.750
This is

10:45.910 --> 10:47.910
Master Zheng's calligraphy
that Chairman Liu has always wanted.

10:47.910 --> 10:49.200
I heard that he's going to hold

10:49.200 --> 10:50.200
a birthday banquet soon.

10:50.200 --> 10:51.270
This gift

10:51.630 --> 10:52.600
is perfect.

10:52.840 --> 10:54.480
What a brilliant contrast of ink,

10:54.480 --> 10:56.120
with slender branches and thick leaves.

10:56.120 --> 10:57.480
For such a grand gift,

10:59.030 --> 11:00.490
I should thank Miss Jiang.

11:00.700 --> 11:01.980
I'm just glad it helps.

11:05.080 --> 11:08.360
But Chairman Liu never sees new officials.

11:08.440 --> 11:10.770
No matter how good the gift is,

11:11.150 --> 11:12.870
it's useless if it can't be delivered.

11:12.870 --> 11:14.730
There's someone who can help you.

11:16.400 --> 11:17.160
Sect Master.

11:19.840 --> 11:20.960
Are you kidding me?

11:21.670 --> 11:23.000
The head of a bunch of swindlers—

11:23.000 --> 11:25.510
what right does he have
to approach Chairman Liu?

11:25.510 --> 11:26.320
The Yin Book.

11:27.120 --> 11:27.910
The Yin Book?

11:28.360 --> 11:29.760
During the Ming Dynasty,

11:30.060 --> 11:32.430
the Imperial Guards
wrote the Yang Book for His Majesty.

11:32.430 --> 11:34.840
It recorded all the

11:34.920 --> 11:36.440
shady deeds of the dynasty's officials.

11:36.440 --> 11:37.810
Sect Master followed suit

11:37.810 --> 11:40.360
and spread spies
around the high officials and nobles.

11:40.360 --> 11:42.020
and compiled his own Yin Book.

11:42.170 --> 11:43.750
The Sect Master used the Yin Book

11:43.750 --> 11:45.870
to help Chairman Liu clear the way

11:45.890 --> 11:47.010
and keep everyone in check.

11:47.010 --> 11:49.540
That's why Chairman Liu trusts him so deeply.

11:50.030 --> 11:51.290
Why should I trust you?

11:51.510 --> 11:52.480
Director Feng,

11:53.000 --> 11:54.530
even if you don't trust him,

11:54.910 --> 11:56.150
you should trust me.

11:56.720 --> 11:58.550
Sect Master put me next to you,

11:58.960 --> 11:59.720
yet I

12:00.270 --> 12:02.360
never set a trap against you.

12:04.550 --> 12:06.870
This is Wang Zhicheng's secret file
from the Yin Book.

12:06.870 --> 12:08.400
Whether it's true or false,

12:08.590 --> 12:10.390
you'll know once you test it out.

12:15.600 --> 12:17.000
If this Yin Book

12:17.030 --> 12:19.240
is really as important as you both say,

12:19.730 --> 12:21.790
why don't you keep it for yourselves?

12:22.740 --> 12:24.270
Something like the Yin Book

12:24.510 --> 12:26.320
can only become a ladder to the sky

12:26.320 --> 12:28.120
in the hands of the right person.

12:28.360 --> 12:30.710
But in the hands of nobodies like us,

12:30.730 --> 12:32.660
it will only bring more trouble.

12:33.030 --> 12:34.390
I can't accept a reward without merit.

12:34.390 --> 12:36.320
You prepared such a big gift for me.

12:36.440 --> 12:37.840
I'm curious—

12:37.910 --> 12:39.910
what do you want from me?

12:40.550 --> 12:41.790
What I want

12:41.810 --> 12:45.010
is for you to help me
eradicate the entire Tianxiang Sect.

12:45.510 --> 12:46.670
In this way,

12:47.120 --> 12:48.790
you can replace him

12:49.100 --> 12:51.500
and become Chairman Liu's right-hand man.

12:55.720 --> 12:57.050
If you run into trouble,

12:57.360 --> 12:58.440
look for me here.

13:00.040 --> 13:01.000
Jialing Hotel?

13:02.150 --> 13:03.950
The strong wind is about to rise.

13:04.270 --> 13:05.780
Now that official business is done,

13:05.780 --> 13:07.540
I have a personal matter

13:08.200 --> 13:09.560
to trouble Sect Master with.

13:09.560 --> 13:10.620
You're too polite.

13:10.670 --> 13:11.600
Let's talk in private.

13:11.600 --> 13:12.480
This way.

13:12.480 --> 13:13.030
Please.

13:19.750 --> 13:20.750
In public,

13:20.910 --> 13:22.170
Wang Zhicheng is down.

13:23.320 --> 13:24.240
In private,

13:25.270 --> 13:26.000
should we

13:26.000 --> 13:27.870
corporate more?

13:28.150 --> 13:29.750
Don't mention cooperation.

13:29.960 --> 13:31.790
It's my honor

13:31.790 --> 13:33.030
to be able to help you.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.550
There is no time like the present.

13:34.550 --> 13:35.840
I happen to have a small matter right now

13:35.840 --> 13:37.360
that I need Sect Master's help with.

13:37.360 --> 13:38.030
Go ahead.

13:38.320 --> 13:40.870
I prepared a birthday gift
for Chairman Liu.

13:42.240 --> 13:44.670
It's a piece of Master Zheng's calligraphy.

13:44.670 --> 13:46.320
You know I'm a rough person.

13:46.320 --> 13:48.960
I don't understand the tastes
of scholars and elites.

13:48.960 --> 13:50.550
So I'd like to invite you

13:50.550 --> 13:52.790
to attend the birthday banquet with me

13:53.120 --> 13:54.750
and put in a good word for me
in front of him.

13:54.750 --> 13:56.080
And while we're at it, help me elevate

13:56.080 --> 13:58.960
the value of Master Zheng's work.

13:59.240 --> 14:00.910
My goodness, such a grand occasion.

14:00.910 --> 14:04.370
I'm just a person of the underworld—
not worthy of being there.

14:06.320 --> 14:09.380
Someone from the underworld
saying they're not worthy

14:09.550 --> 14:10.840
is like a soldier saying

14:10.840 --> 14:12.550
they're scared of blood.

14:14.120 --> 14:15.120
So I advise you

14:15.120 --> 14:16.720
not to decline.

14:20.630 --> 14:21.320
Alright.

14:21.320 --> 14:23.390
Since you've put it that way,

14:23.720 --> 14:24.390
I'll...

14:24.750 --> 14:25.720
I'll go.

14:25.720 --> 14:26.550
Great.

14:27.720 --> 14:28.870
Also,

14:30.750 --> 14:32.470
those two people are still useful to me.

14:32.470 --> 14:33.870
Sect Master, could you

14:34.510 --> 14:35.510
make an exception?

14:35.510 --> 14:37.970
You're really making this difficult for me.

14:38.120 --> 14:39.910
But since you've asked,

14:40.720 --> 14:42.750
I must give you some face.

14:43.240 --> 14:44.100
How about this?

14:44.600 --> 14:46.000
I'll let one of them go.

14:46.150 --> 14:47.280
Who will you choose?

14:57.510 --> 14:58.200
Miss Jiang.

14:58.670 --> 14:59.670
You may leave now.

14:59.720 --> 15:01.270
Only one of those two?

15:01.510 --> 15:03.050
But I have use for both of them.

15:03.050 --> 15:04.690
Releasing only one makes it hard for me.

15:04.690 --> 15:06.720
You're the one making it hard for me.

15:06.750 --> 15:08.750
I've promised you to let one go.

15:08.780 --> 15:09.850
Besides,

15:10.150 --> 15:12.030
I have to take you to Chairman Liu.

15:12.320 --> 15:13.550
I've given you

15:13.550 --> 15:15.320
enough respect and kindness.

15:15.340 --> 15:16.510
Shouldn't you

15:16.510 --> 15:17.960
do the same for me?

15:19.550 --> 15:20.720
That makes sense.

15:22.350 --> 15:24.280
How about an exchange of hostages?

15:25.200 --> 15:26.860
Who carries that much weight?

15:30.150 --> 15:31.270
Zhang Dancheng.

15:37.770 --> 15:38.530
Mentor.

15:39.790 --> 15:40.840
Why are you back?

15:42.690 --> 15:45.140
How could I not come for such a big matter?

15:45.320 --> 15:46.630
You shouldn't have come back.

15:46.630 --> 15:47.540
Sect Master is in the room.

15:47.540 --> 15:48.670
I've talked to Feng Siyuan.

15:48.670 --> 15:49.420
He will take me away.

15:49.420 --> 15:50.660
Get out of here.

15:56.080 --> 15:57.670
Since I dare to come,

15:59.440 --> 16:00.870
I have a plan.

16:01.180 --> 16:02.300
You taught me.

16:03.960 --> 16:06.020
I know exactly what you're thinking.

16:16.930 --> 16:18.080
When I'm gone,

16:18.360 --> 16:19.750
you must remember

16:20.200 --> 16:21.870
how your path forward

16:22.450 --> 16:23.660
should be walked.

16:28.960 --> 16:29.890
Zhang Dancheng.

16:30.550 --> 16:32.150
After I kill the Sect Master,

16:32.680 --> 16:34.480
I'll come back for your life.

16:35.440 --> 16:36.320
Kid,

16:37.360 --> 16:38.560
I'm returning my life

16:39.200 --> 16:40.240
to you.

16:52.580 --> 16:53.820
What a rare guest.

16:55.040 --> 16:57.640
It's truly been a while since you've been back.

17:00.030 --> 17:00.790
Something's up?

17:00.790 --> 17:01.550
Something's up.

17:01.550 --> 17:02.600
What is it?

17:04.160 --> 17:05.089
A life exchange.

17:06.640 --> 17:07.720
Tired of living?

17:07.720 --> 17:09.240
Have been for a long time.

17:10.890 --> 17:11.930
Deal.

17:19.819 --> 17:21.020
How do you want to die?

17:21.640 --> 17:22.880
I have a choice?

17:23.680 --> 17:24.750
Yes.

17:25.000 --> 17:27.109
How about I set up a table of food and wine?

17:27.109 --> 17:28.109
I'll have a drink.

17:28.230 --> 17:29.550
And you have a little too.

17:29.550 --> 17:30.610
Tomorrow morning,

17:30.880 --> 17:32.720
I'll hold a grand funeral for you.

17:32.720 --> 17:34.510
I promise you'll go out in style.

17:34.510 --> 17:35.510
Too much trouble.

17:35.920 --> 17:36.830
Not at all.

17:37.270 --> 17:38.480
It's worth it for you.

17:38.510 --> 17:39.670
Just like what I said

17:39.690 --> 17:41.890
when I asked Old Sect Master to save you—

17:42.210 --> 17:43.420
you are a talent.

17:43.450 --> 17:44.690
You flatter me.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.130
I'm not that capable.

17:46.150 --> 17:47.960
If I were,

17:47.960 --> 17:49.440
I wouldn't have let Old Sect Master

17:49.440 --> 17:51.160
die in your hands.

17:52.330 --> 17:54.090
You still remember this?

17:54.480 --> 17:56.740
Old Sect Master
wanted to disband Tianxiang Sect.

17:56.740 --> 17:59.260
Where would our hundreds of brothers go?

17:59.620 --> 18:01.420
What would be their livelihood?

18:02.880 --> 18:04.070
I had no choice.

18:05.400 --> 18:07.680
Every generation brings forth new talents,

18:07.680 --> 18:09.070
so I took this position

18:09.550 --> 18:11.280
and became the new Sect Master.

18:11.550 --> 18:13.410
Does Shangguan Hong think so too?

18:14.020 --> 18:15.310
I really don't know.

18:15.790 --> 18:17.270
I've been thinking about this
for many years—

18:17.270 --> 18:19.130
and still haven't figured it out.

18:19.270 --> 18:20.470
Why don't you tell me?

18:21.680 --> 18:23.160
I was blind back then.

18:24.620 --> 18:26.550
I shouldn't have brought her back.

18:30.160 --> 18:32.610
[Eight years ago]

18:48.270 --> 18:49.110
Senior.

18:58.460 --> 19:00.060
When did the child pass away?

19:01.270 --> 19:02.350
He died of illness.

19:02.850 --> 19:04.580
It hasn't even been half a year.

19:05.520 --> 19:07.050
How did you find this place?

19:07.880 --> 19:09.280
Shangguan Chengming...

19:10.750 --> 19:12.350
He took your surname?

19:12.690 --> 19:13.440
Yes.

19:14.310 --> 19:15.650
I don't want him to know

19:15.930 --> 19:17.460
anything about his father.

19:17.500 --> 19:19.630
His father is already the Sect Master.

19:20.060 --> 19:21.520
I thought he died long ago.

19:21.860 --> 19:22.940
He got there

19:22.970 --> 19:25.520
by killing the Old Sect Master, Shen Yunhe,

19:25.540 --> 19:26.830
to take that position.

19:27.160 --> 19:29.290
With him, Tianxiang Sect has changed.

19:29.290 --> 19:32.440
The entire sect is an absolute mess.

19:33.130 --> 19:34.790
What does it have to do with me?

19:35.310 --> 19:36.570
I want to take you back.

19:41.030 --> 19:42.030
You want to use me

19:43.160 --> 19:44.270
to threaten him?

19:46.510 --> 19:47.440
WIth you around,

19:48.440 --> 19:50.480
I can guarantee he steps down

19:51.190 --> 19:52.790
without spilling any blood.

19:53.000 --> 19:55.110
This is the best way I can think of.

19:57.590 --> 19:59.250
In the entire Tianxiang Sect,

19:59.680 --> 20:02.610
you're the only one who still believes in sentiment.

20:03.090 --> 20:05.170
Now that he's the Sect Master,

20:05.390 --> 20:07.220
how could he, for an old lover,

20:07.750 --> 20:08.880
give up his empire?

20:17.170 --> 20:19.830
As long as you can't bring yourself to kill me...

20:21.620 --> 20:22.750
I've made up my mind.

20:24.690 --> 20:25.750
I'll take you back.

20:39.510 --> 20:42.230
You used Shangguan Hong
to force me to abdicate

20:42.360 --> 20:45.020
and brought a little swindler
to pretend to be my son.

20:45.020 --> 20:46.910
But what you didn't expect is that

20:47.220 --> 20:49.820
my relationship
with Shangguan Hong was over.

20:50.000 --> 20:51.260
That little swindler—

20:51.700 --> 20:53.160
you didn't teach him well.

20:53.680 --> 20:55.310
You taught him to be too kind.

20:55.550 --> 20:57.640
I know you already knew

20:57.640 --> 20:59.050
he would come back to save me,

20:59.050 --> 21:01.050
which is why you agreed to let him go.

21:01.240 --> 21:02.900
On the road to the underworld,

21:03.270 --> 21:04.730
I'll find you a companion.

21:05.590 --> 21:07.610
You're so cruel.

21:08.310 --> 21:09.400
Not as evil as you.

21:09.830 --> 21:10.640
You're too polite.

21:10.640 --> 21:12.000
You flatter me.

21:14.520 --> 21:15.980
Let me tell you something.

21:17.370 --> 21:20.300
You've actually seen
the real Shangguan Chengming.

21:32.990 --> 21:34.360
From now on,

21:35.120 --> 21:37.400
you are my, Jin Buhuan's, disciple.

22:06.010 --> 22:06.860
I'm sorry.

22:08.200 --> 22:09.960
I tried my best to stop him,

22:10.580 --> 22:11.730
but I failed.

22:15.590 --> 22:17.650
Once Mentor decides to do something,

22:19.270 --> 22:20.420
no one can stop him.

22:21.750 --> 22:22.720
Here.

22:24.000 --> 22:24.880
What is this?

22:24.880 --> 22:27.680
This is the hot syrup
Grandpa Jin taught us to make.

22:27.680 --> 22:29.920
Grandpa Jin says hot syrup is better than immortal soup.

22:29.920 --> 22:31.180
It's super delicious!

22:31.270 --> 22:31.960
Really?

22:35.200 --> 22:36.130
It's delicious.

22:36.510 --> 22:37.200
Thank you.

22:37.660 --> 22:38.660
Go have fun.

22:42.140 --> 22:43.450
Look at these kids.

22:43.830 --> 22:45.350
Without this orphanage,

22:45.600 --> 22:47.680
they might be begging on the streets today,

22:47.680 --> 22:50.240
and tomorrow they might be targeting
someone's purse.

22:50.240 --> 22:51.440
When they grow up,

22:52.960 --> 22:53.960
will they think that in life

22:53.960 --> 22:56.480
there are only two paths: deceive or be deceived?

22:56.480 --> 22:58.540
I helped Mentor set up this orphanage

22:58.590 --> 22:59.480
hoping to

23:00.000 --> 23:01.600
give these children a chance

23:01.960 --> 23:03.960
a chance to choose a different life.

23:04.940 --> 23:08.370
In the past, your mentor taught you
to strike fast and con slow.

23:08.370 --> 23:09.970
Now that these kids have you,

23:10.960 --> 23:13.090
they won't need to learn those things.

23:14.720 --> 23:16.780
The right path is always hard to walk.

23:19.020 --> 23:20.590
But I'll keep going.

23:57.410 --> 23:58.170
How did it go?

23:58.590 --> 24:00.110
The information the girls collected

24:00.110 --> 24:01.050
will be ready soon.

24:01.050 --> 24:02.380
Almost 4 boxes of them.

24:03.400 --> 24:05.070
I've prepared the boat tickets

24:05.070 --> 24:06.070
to send them away.

24:06.160 --> 24:07.110
You must

24:07.480 --> 24:08.440
protect them for me.

24:08.440 --> 24:09.170
Don't worry.

24:09.320 --> 24:10.920
I will take good care of them.

24:11.310 --> 24:13.550
I've been preparing
for this day for a long time.

24:13.550 --> 24:14.400
This time,

24:14.920 --> 24:15.850
it will succeed.

24:17.550 --> 24:26.150
[Richards Grand Hotel]

24:23.720 --> 24:24.860
Chairman Liu gracing us tonight

24:24.860 --> 24:26.720
is my, Siyuan's, greatest honor.

24:27.240 --> 24:28.160
Little Feng,

24:28.760 --> 24:30.310
you handle things very well.

24:30.310 --> 24:30.910
Right now,

24:30.920 --> 24:32.790
Yucheng needs talents like you.

24:32.930 --> 24:36.330
I will have to rely heavily on you
in the future, Chairman Liu.

25:07.200 --> 25:08.640
Congratulations, Director Feng.

25:08.640 --> 25:10.230
You're about to be promoted.

25:10.230 --> 25:11.640
With Chairman Liu's connection,

25:11.640 --> 25:12.720
your future career

25:13.030 --> 25:14.360
will surely skyrocket.

25:14.940 --> 25:16.200
Whether it skyrockets

25:18.740 --> 25:20.400
still depends on the Yin Book.

25:20.870 --> 25:22.260
I have only one goal:

25:23.270 --> 25:25.130
to eradicate the Tianxiang Sect.

25:28.830 --> 25:30.490
Sect Master is very cautious.

25:30.740 --> 25:32.880
He won't hide the Yin Book
in Tianxiang Sect.

25:32.880 --> 25:34.060
Go to the Yuzhong River,

25:34.060 --> 25:36.170
under the riverbank of the third stone bridge upstream,

25:36.170 --> 25:37.410
find a hidden post,

25:37.920 --> 25:39.980
and you'll be able to get the Yin Book.

25:42.200 --> 25:42.860
Don't move!

25:43.960 --> 25:44.550
Get out!

25:44.920 --> 25:45.350
Yes.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.480
Feng Siyuan.

26:22.160 --> 26:23.920
Your time is coming.

27:13.320 --> 27:15.360
Zhang Dancheng is dead.

27:17.560 --> 27:19.640
He stabbed himself to death

27:22.210 --> 27:24.170
just to trade for your life.

27:24.880 --> 27:26.280
But I don't understand.

27:27.480 --> 27:29.720
Why did you come back

27:29.750 --> 27:31.150
instead of running away?

27:31.530 --> 27:32.860
Later, I figured it out.

27:34.300 --> 27:35.290
Feng Siyuan—

27:36.000 --> 27:37.440
he came looking for me time and again.

27:37.440 --> 27:38.240
I guessed that

27:38.240 --> 27:39.960
you must be hiding behind him.

27:40.100 --> 27:41.480
Do you think I would be so stupid

27:41.480 --> 27:43.000
as to let him raid my sect?

27:43.910 --> 27:44.830
Don't worry.

27:45.150 --> 27:47.080
Everyone has cleared out long ago.

27:53.040 --> 27:55.570
You're pretty good
at pretending to be my son.

27:56.860 --> 27:57.900
Drop the act.

27:58.510 --> 28:00.240
It's just the two of us here now.

28:00.680 --> 28:02.810
Haven't you always wanted to kill me?

28:03.680 --> 28:04.370
Come on.

28:05.220 --> 28:06.420
I'll grant your wish.

28:08.660 --> 28:09.310
What?

28:09.750 --> 28:11.410
Can't bring yourself to do it?

28:11.880 --> 28:12.680
I know

28:13.290 --> 28:15.850
in your eyes, I'm a bad person.

28:17.880 --> 28:19.510
Then who is a good person?

28:20.160 --> 28:21.090
Old Sect Master?

28:21.470 --> 28:22.600
Was he a good person?

28:23.240 --> 28:23.880
Back then,

28:24.190 --> 28:26.610
he used the slogan of overthrowing Qing
and restoring Ming

28:26.610 --> 28:28.800
to make hundreds of brothers starve

28:28.820 --> 28:30.680
while scamming and dying for him.

28:30.720 --> 28:32.980
In the end, many ended up dead or injured.

28:35.670 --> 28:37.470
He was a bad guy!

28:39.950 --> 28:40.910
And me?

28:41.920 --> 28:44.120
I made sure the brothers ate well,

28:44.150 --> 28:45.700
wore decent clothes,

28:45.720 --> 28:47.440
and looked like respectable men on the streets.

28:47.440 --> 28:48.200
When others see them,

28:48.200 --> 28:50.030
they even have to greet them with a smile.

28:50.030 --> 28:50.830
It was me!

28:50.850 --> 28:52.170
Who gave them dignity!

28:52.320 --> 28:54.470
You gave them dignity?

28:56.430 --> 28:59.290
You clearly made them live worse than pigs and dogs.

29:01.250 --> 29:02.780
You're still too green.

29:05.740 --> 29:07.550
Sometimes I think

29:07.910 --> 29:10.420
you are a bit like me when I was young.

29:10.440 --> 29:12.130
You should understand me.

29:13.110 --> 29:14.180
Now it seems

29:14.630 --> 29:16.020
you're still too young.

29:16.550 --> 29:18.250
That's why you've ended up on a dead end.

29:18.250 --> 29:20.110
I'm not the one who's at a dead end,

29:21.130 --> 29:21.960
it's you.

29:22.230 --> 29:22.880
Yes.

29:22.900 --> 29:24.610
Of course you want me to be at a dead end.

29:24.610 --> 29:26.210
So you turned to Feng Siyuan.

29:26.250 --> 29:27.580
Let me tell you

29:27.960 --> 29:29.360
what kind of person he is.

29:29.550 --> 29:31.200
When he was a head soldier,

29:31.200 --> 29:33.270
he survived by pretending to be dead.

29:33.710 --> 29:34.970
Now you're telling him

29:35.000 --> 29:36.680
I have some Yin Book.

29:36.700 --> 29:38.570
With it, he can become successfull.

29:38.570 --> 29:40.590
You knew he would ask me for it.

29:40.590 --> 29:41.550
If I can't give it to him,

29:41.550 --> 29:42.720
I'll die.

29:44.030 --> 29:45.290
Is that what you think?

29:52.890 --> 29:55.000
But what you don't know is

29:55.520 --> 29:57.720
I really have this Yin Book.

29:59.680 --> 30:01.270
And I will cooperate very well

30:01.270 --> 30:02.920
with Feng Siyuan.

30:03.400 --> 30:04.260
What about you?

30:06.030 --> 30:07.310
In his eyes,

30:07.310 --> 30:09.350
you're just an abandoned pawn.

30:10.170 --> 30:11.380
You're useless.

30:14.700 --> 30:16.590
So I advise you

30:17.090 --> 30:18.570
to just go die.

30:19.710 --> 30:21.840
Die far away, don't dirty my turf.

30:22.110 --> 30:23.020
Thanks to you,

30:23.040 --> 30:24.720
Yanzi and Silly Liang

30:24.970 --> 30:26.420
die a quick death too.

30:30.900 --> 30:33.300
Speak of the devil.

30:50.770 --> 30:51.630
Director Feng.

30:51.670 --> 30:53.320
You were tricked by him.

30:53.480 --> 30:54.590
This Yin Book

30:54.870 --> 30:56.020
really exists.

30:57.050 --> 31:00.330
But it's in my brain—
you can't take it away.

31:00.630 --> 31:02.790
But whatever you want to know or ask,

31:02.810 --> 31:04.090
just ask.

31:04.160 --> 31:05.710
I will definitely tell you.

31:07.760 --> 31:09.480
As the saying goes,

31:09.510 --> 31:12.440
relying on oneself is better than relying on others.

31:33.070 --> 31:34.030
What is this?

31:34.090 --> 31:34.850
Sect Master.

31:38.230 --> 31:40.230
Why can't you recognize the Yin Book

31:40.320 --> 31:42.120
in front of Director Feng?

31:44.000 --> 31:45.570
With this set of Yin Book,

31:45.810 --> 31:47.040
I shan't keep the one

31:47.840 --> 31:48.990
in your mind.

31:56.480 --> 31:58.930
You conjured something out of nothing.

32:05.590 --> 32:07.030
Don't worry.

32:07.450 --> 32:08.690
Your retribution

32:09.720 --> 32:10.680
is not over yet.

32:16.910 --> 32:18.150
Good job.

32:21.680 --> 32:22.830
I'll go with you.

32:37.630 --> 32:38.740
Your blood debt

32:40.080 --> 32:41.680
must be paid with your blood.

34:47.080 --> 34:48.510
These are people
who have lost their families

34:48.510 --> 34:50.070
because of Tianxiang Sect.

34:52.550 --> 34:53.610
They are here today

34:53.850 --> 34:55.210
to send you off.

34:58.950 --> 34:59.950
How does it feel?

35:02.800 --> 35:04.150
It hurts

35:05.860 --> 35:06.780
so darn much.

35:13.630 --> 35:14.800
They hurt more than you.

35:14.800 --> 35:16.280
Father!

35:17.410 --> 35:19.810
Father!

35:19.970 --> 35:22.380
Daughter!

35:24.110 --> 35:25.800
Father!

35:26.000 --> 35:26.730
Stepmother.

35:26.840 --> 35:27.510
Jialiang!

35:27.880 --> 35:28.480
Jiashu!

35:28.960 --> 35:29.760
Jialiang!

35:30.840 --> 35:32.110
You caused all of it.

35:34.510 --> 35:35.840
The Tianxiang Sect

35:37.440 --> 35:39.690
won't let you get away with this!

35:44.150 --> 35:46.150
There's no Tianxiang Sect anymore.

35:48.070 --> 35:50.000
Don't you know how to tell fortune?

35:52.000 --> 35:54.060
Have a go at how long more you can live.

35:55.070 --> 35:56.360
Buy me a bowl

35:56.470 --> 35:57.280
of wontons.

36:50.970 --> 36:53.010
I am here today

36:53.480 --> 36:54.550
to both expose

36:54.590 --> 36:55.590
and atone.

36:55.920 --> 36:56.840
Tianxiang Sect

36:56.840 --> 36:59.000
used to rob the rich and help the poor.

36:59.230 --> 37:00.280
But today,

37:00.990 --> 37:02.320
it's downright filthy.

37:02.710 --> 37:03.950
Extra! Extra!

37:04.410 --> 37:07.230
The biggest fraud organization in Yucheng
has been cracked down!

37:07.230 --> 37:11.560
The Tianxiang Sect uses divination to kill
and scam people out of their money!

37:13.550 --> 37:14.610
What are you doing?

37:29.000 --> 37:29.760
Execute!

37:32.360 --> 37:33.220
Raise your gun.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.590
Good!

37:42.110 --> 37:43.110
Great!

37:52.040 --> 37:53.440
This Liang, seriously.

37:53.470 --> 37:54.550
He ran away

37:54.850 --> 37:56.250
without saying goodbye.

37:56.440 --> 37:58.360
He said if we said goodbye
in person,

37:58.360 --> 38:00.290
his wheels might not work anymore.

38:00.480 --> 38:01.410
What does he plan

38:01.590 --> 38:02.650
to do in the future?

38:02.670 --> 38:03.510
He told me

38:04.030 --> 38:05.690
the happiest thing he did
in Tianxiang Sect

38:05.690 --> 38:06.480
is cracking down

38:06.480 --> 38:07.680
on Plum Blossom Sect,

38:08.280 --> 38:09.680
saving so many children.

38:09.950 --> 38:10.870
He plans to

38:11.150 --> 38:12.150
travel around

38:12.630 --> 38:14.160
to teach scammers a lesson.

38:16.880 --> 38:17.740
What about you?

38:18.590 --> 38:20.390
What's your plan for the future?

38:20.630 --> 38:22.630
I'll think about it after leaving Yucheng.

38:22.630 --> 38:23.690
Being further away

38:24.190 --> 38:25.190
makes some things

38:26.360 --> 38:27.550
become lighter.

38:28.400 --> 38:29.200
You're right.

38:29.480 --> 38:30.400
The past

38:30.550 --> 38:31.440
is too heavy.

38:32.470 --> 38:33.670
It's time to let it go.

38:34.710 --> 38:35.590
People

38:35.900 --> 38:37.650
should look forward.

38:51.480 --> 38:53.010
We're going to say goodbye.

38:53.960 --> 38:55.190
Give me a gift.

38:56.150 --> 38:56.920
Sure.

38:57.880 --> 38:58.920
What do you want?

38:59.590 --> 39:01.280
I want to know your birthday.

39:08.710 --> 39:09.760
It's today.

39:11.320 --> 39:12.450
What a coincidence.

39:15.840 --> 39:17.480
I never thought

39:17.800 --> 39:18.920
birthday

39:19.520 --> 39:21.520
is something to be happy about.

39:23.070 --> 39:24.550
But from now on,

39:25.280 --> 39:26.630
I can finally

39:27.490 --> 39:29.050
live for myself.

39:32.800 --> 39:33.680
Thank you.

39:37.190 --> 39:38.400
I hope

39:40.320 --> 39:41.360
every minute and every second

39:41.360 --> 39:43.000
from now on belongs to you,

39:45.460 --> 39:47.260
and that you're happy every day.

40:00.420 --> 40:02.950
♪ Under the old city wall ♪

40:02.970 --> 40:06.520
♪ The rain fell gently that year ♪

40:07.390 --> 40:13.350
♪ You walked by with an umbrella,
saying loneliness didn't scare you ♪

40:11.250 --> 40:12.600
Happy birthday.

40:14.410 --> 40:16.710
♪ In the future, the blades ♪

40:15.400 --> 40:16.650
From now on,

40:16.760 --> 40:18.400
every minute and every second

40:17.510 --> 40:21.110
♪ Are all hidden in smiles ♪

40:18.800 --> 40:20.440
all belong to us.

40:22.170 --> 40:29.420
♪ An impulsive, spiteful remark
cut deep into my heart ♪

40:29.640 --> 40:32.240
♪ You fully know ♪

40:32.640 --> 40:35.630
♪ How weak I am ♪

40:35.980 --> 40:44.090
♪ Yet you always turn around, shielding me
from harsh words and cold daggers ♪

40:44.950 --> 40:48.410
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

40:48.430 --> 40:51.340
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

40:51.980 --> 40:55.490
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

40:55.520 --> 40:58.090
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

40:59.000 --> 41:02.540
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

41:02.570 --> 41:05.260
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

41:05.980 --> 41:09.370
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

41:09.570 --> 41:14.480
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

41:37.580 --> 41:40.990
[Six months later]

41:58.840 --> 41:59.510
Jiaxian,

41:59.710 --> 42:00.640
a letter for you.

42:02.590 --> 42:03.280
Thanks.

42:03.300 --> 42:04.220
Bye.

42:04.600 --> 42:06.290
[To Wang Jiaxian]

42:18.030 --> 42:19.030
Jiaxian,

42:19.280 --> 42:20.280
how have you been?

42:20.670 --> 42:21.840
I now have a disciple,

42:21.840 --> 42:24.100
and I had him
to write this letter for you.

42:24.480 --> 42:25.800
In Yucheng,

42:25.800 --> 42:27.460
I felt suffocated in my chest.

42:27.800 --> 42:30.440
I've been able to breathe well
since I came out.

42:30.880 --> 42:32.550
The Chrysler you gave me—

42:32.670 --> 42:34.320
it's truly a gas guzzler.

42:34.480 --> 42:35.940
I can't drive it that much.

42:36.880 --> 42:38.670
If you have time, shall we meet?

42:39.320 --> 42:40.320
Bring Feiyan too.

42:40.550 --> 42:41.760
The three of us

42:41.960 --> 42:44.220
and try doing something together again.

42:44.510 --> 42:46.150
I hope all is well with you

42:46.440 --> 42:47.840
and things are peaceful.

42:48.770 --> 42:49.900
Missing you, Liang.

42:55.000 --> 42:55.920
Wang Jiaxian.

42:58.670 --> 42:59.510
Sir,

43:00.070 --> 43:00.920
you know me?

43:01.840 --> 43:02.570
My name is...

43:03.040 --> 43:04.340
Shangguan Chengming.
